# Token discipline

- Prefer model **Auto**; subagents use `model: inherit`.
- Do not pin Opus/Sonnet/frontier models on subagent launches unless captain orders it.
- Avoid parallel subagents unless tasks are independent and do not edit the same files.
- Prefer new chat per phase/module; do not drag product PRD context into a one-line patch.
- Load pipeline skills when invoked; do not dump all templates into every reply.
- Summarize tool output; do not paste huge logs into the captain-facing answer.
